      "B": {
        "reading_checked": "If the horizontal axis encodes Advertising Spend ($ thousands), the vertical axis encodes Sales ($ thousands), and the labeled monthly points are comparable observations, then points progressing rightward and upward indicate a positive midyear association between spend and sales. Approving a broader budget increase follows only if this association is accepted as sufficient decision evidence despite the chart's limited period and lack of causal or profitability evidence.",
